<title>POLAND: NFI Kazimierz Wielki nets PLN 8.3 mln H1.</title>
<headline>NFI Kazimierz Wielki nets PLN 8.3 mln H1.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish National Investment Fund (NFI) Kazimierz Wielki (No. 7) preliminary results for the first half of 1997, in millions of zlotys:</p>
<p>					H1 1997		   H1 1996</p>
<p>  Net profit			  8.30		     17.88 loss</p>
<p>  Investment portfolio	  407.58		    378.59</p>
<p>  Liabilities and provisions   29.51		     13.75</p>
<p>  Net assets			384.62		    369.06</p>
<p>  Assets per share (PLN)	 12.40		     10.50</p>
<p>NOTE: The full company name is Narodowy Fundusz Inwestycyjny im Kazimierza Wielkiego SA. -- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
